      "writtenOn": "2023-01-25T17:49:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Infact, in the cross bug, we have got confirmation from vendor side that above 30 % only fan will start running. so, for the specific board, if any request for a duty cycle below this value, fan will stop runnning. So, if not  limiting the upper  value, atleast , the lower value must be limited , is what i think.",
