      "writtenOn": "2023-01-25T19:51:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here are the changes I suggest:\n1. Add EC_CMD_GET_FAN_CONFIG. It takes a fan index and returns fan spec (rpm_min, rpm_max, duty_min, duty_max, rpm_start, and flags).\n2. Change DPTF to clamp duty cycles based on returned (duty_min, duty_max).",
      "parentUuid": "465fcf8b_c7ca5ca0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 190,
